__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store

# Local state that must never enter the history: environment files and keys, editor and agent-tool
# settings, virtual environments and tool caches. These rules prevent accidents in new work; they are
# not how the published history was sanitized. They are also this release's own exemptions from the
# stray-file check in tools/pack_pin.py, so each names inert local state only.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
.venv/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.claude/settings.local.json

# The append-only routing evidence MUST be versioned. The user's global
# gitignore excludes *.jsonl, which silently kept this file untracked for six
# commits — the routing table is regenerated from it, so losing it would mean
# regenerating a view from nothing. Negation must come after any broader rule.
!policy/observations.jsonl
